# measured baseline the README quotes, and they let a reader run
# `evaluate.py --compare baseline strict` without spending any tokens.
!lessons/07-evaluation/runs/
!lessons/07-evaluation/runs/*.json
**/traces/
**/.cache/
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
**/index/
**/chroma/

